<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>You can literally float on any building you made. 
Follow this steps to the macro to work:

1.- Change editing keybind to G (in fortnite)
2.- Assign the macro to a keybind (keyran)
3.- Start the macros
4.- Everytime you press the assigned keybind it will work
5.- Enjoy the macros

if you have any issues with this, contact me or another macro creator.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 10 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 10 1
Delay 5 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyDown 10 1
Delay 5 ms
KeyUp 10 1
Delay 5 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
